  "translate_en|mods/beyondTheInfection/42.0/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Tooltip.json|Tooltip_BTI_PillA": "Stops the zombie virus infection for 3 hours. If taken while healthy, it causes mild side effects.<br>Low-intensity antiviral that blocks viral replication by interfering with the pathogen's RNA synthesis.<br>Active ingredient: Zidovirin.",
  "translate_en|mods/beyondTheInfection/42.0/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Tooltip.json|Tooltip_BTI_PillB": "Rolls back the infection by 4 hours and stops it for 6 hours. If taken while healthy, it causes moderate side effects.<br>High-intensity protease inhibitor that saturates viral enzymes, blocking replication and reversing prior progression.<br>Active ingredient: Lopinavirol-B.",
  "translate_en|mods/beyondTheInfection/42.0/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Tooltip.json|Tooltip_BTI_PillC": "Rolls back the infection by 12 hours and stops it for 12 hours. If taken while healthy, it causes severe side effects.<br>Experimental immune-response modulating serum. Shock treatment with severe systemic chemical toxicity.<br>Codename: Compound KX-93.",
